      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Experiencing the same issue.Additional test results:\n\nReproduced on a different PC as well\n\nOccurs on Live, Open Beta, and Unity 6 builds\n\nLowering mouse polling rate from 1000Hz to 125Hz makes it worse\n\nIncreasing VRChat mouse look sensitivity from 22 to 100 significantly improves it\n\nSetting Windows mouse pointer speed from 6 to 1 greatly reduces the jitter (but unusable for normal use)\n\nChanging mouse DPI did not noticeably affect the intensity of the jitter",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
